WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.200
If you're into trading cards, tabletop games, or just looking for a new place
to meet other local gamers, Gilded Fates Cards & Games in Emporia is definitely worth checking out.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:17.040
They carry games like Pokémon, Magic: The Gathering, Lorcana,
board games, tabletop games, and other gaming products.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.190
What really makes Gilded Fates stand out is the community.
It isn't just a place to buy games.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:28.170
You can meet other players, trade cards, learn something new, and actually sit down and play.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:36.050
They also host regular events, including Lorcana on Wednesdays,
Friday Night Fates, and Pokémon open play on Saturdays.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:44.885
Whether you're an experienced player, a collector, or someone looking for a new hobby,
stop by Gilded Fates and see what they have to offer.
